  (text "Commander STRIP TEST BOARD (rev T0) - everything that is NEW on the mainboard, without the codec core:\nPoE converter, PoE / battery selector, battery port, USB5744 + four SuperSpeed bays, USB2517 + five Hi-Speed bays.\nA stock Radxa ZERO 3E plays the codec core and connects with two USB-C cables and a few jumper wires.\nThe shared sheets (poe, battery) are the mainboard's own netlist files, listed in shared.txt; the two hub\nsheets come from the same generator.  This sheet holds only what replaces the codec core." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "14bad221-9e82-50ec-9577-5e4119f06da9"))
